              "expression": "// Two variable definitions\nconst concSO2 = OLI.random(0.55, 0.95, 3) .toFixed(3);\nconst concO2 = OLI.random(0.045, 0.99, 3) .toFixed(3);\nconst squareSO2 = (concSO2*concSO2);\nconst varMultiply = (squareSO2*concO2*4.32);\nconst correct = Math.sqrt(varMultiply);\nconst corRnd = (correct) .toPrecision(3);\nconst corLow = correct*0.98;\nconst corHigh = correct*1.02;\n\n// Expose variables to OLI\nmodule.exports = {\n concSO2,\n concO2,\n squareSO2,\n varMultiply,\n correct,\n corRnd,\n corLow,\n corHigh\n};\n",
